				Time="2011-09-12T03:56:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>えええ！　あなぬけのヒモを
使われたら　はぐれちゃうよお？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T03:56:54" />
