	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d24r0301_swbell_13"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>えええ！　あなをほるの　わざを
つかわれたら　はぐれちゃうよお？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T03:56:54" />
